ass=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Purpose\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Purpose</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Home to Bamboo</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.0.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">January 14th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\nOok lake is a lake that was located on near the end of Finlay Island. Surrounding the lake is a cliff and a beach containing <a href=\"/wiki/Bamboo\" title=\"Bamboo\">Bamboo</a>. It has since been moved to the jungle area on Ferwater Island as of the 2024 Spring Update. \n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/65/Ooksign.png/revision/latest?cb=20240331182838\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Image teasing its return.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/65/Ooksign.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20240331182838\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"172\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Ooksign.png\" data-image-key=\"Ooksign.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Ooksign.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Image teasing its return.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/df/Ooklakenew.png/revision/latest?cb=20240417220548\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Ook Lake&#39;s new location. Two plants grow in the lake: water lily and lotus.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/df/Ooklakenew.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20240417220548\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"136\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Ooklakenew.png\" data-image-key=\"Ooklakenew.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Ooklakenew.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Ook Lake's new location. Two plants grow in the lake: water lily and lotus.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:Locations_Nav\" title=\"Template:Locations Nav\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/